$8061 ; track C's
$8066 TranspStore
$806B TranspHold ; a hold: the count
$806E TranspSetWait
$8071 HeightWait ; HeightWait+1: patterns left with HeightRepeat's height
$807A HeightRepeat ; HeightRepeat+1: the repeated height
$807E HeightPointer ; HeightPointer+1: the height stream
$8083 ; bit 0 clear: the height for this pattern only
$808C HeightRun ; bit 0 set: the height and a count byte
$8099 SetHeight ; LineCounter = the height (the lines - 1)
$809C LinkerPointer ; LinkerPointer+1: the linker, three track addresses a pattern
$809F ; track A's address
