@isub $897A DEFW AYReg12+3,AYReg13+3,ChanAInstrSpeed+1,ChanBInstrSpeed+1
@isub $8982 DEFW ChanCInstrSpeed+1
@isub $8986 DEFW ChanAInstrLoops,ChanBInstrLoops,ChanCInstrLoops

@module starkos-song ; the song SK10
@about The intro tune, a STarKos song compiled for $8990 (its header holds the address; the player does not relocate it). 1845 bytes: the header, the transposition, height and special-track streams, the linker (48 patterns), the instrument table and 13 instruments, 38 tracks and one special track. The text src/res/music/sk10.txt holds it in STarKos's terms; tools/sk10.py encode builds build/sound/sk10.bin from it for the INCBIN.
$8990 b Song 16 ; the song SK10 (src/res/music/sk10.txt)
> Read by Init (the header) and Play (the streams, the tracks, the instruments). Not written.
@res music/sk10.bin
